   "text": "Worker otj-mcp\nroute oceanofjobs.com/mcp, JSON-RPC\nover HTTPS, fails open. 16 tools. No\ntoken: search_jobs, get_job,\nget_company. With a token: save_job,\nlist_saved_jobs, remove_saved_job,\nlist_alerts, create_alert,\nupdate_alert, delete_alert,\nget_preferences, update_preferences,\nqueue_for_auto_apply,\nlist_auto_apply_queue,\nremove_from_auto_apply_queue",
   "originalText": "Worker otj-mcp\nroute oceanofjobs.com/mcp, JSON-RPC over HTTPS, fails open. 16 tools. No token: search_jobs, get_job, get_company. With a token: save_job, list_saved_jobs, remove_saved_job, list_alerts, create_alert, update_alert, delete_alert, get_preferences, update_preferences, queue_for_auto_apply, list_auto_apply_queue, remove_from_auto_apply_queue",
